{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076950/extras/9777b435159bb6d44f348bd1a4ab20ef.avif?t=1773449357\" width=300 height=485 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world is not fair to you. The things you need are so simple, and yet malicious forces and careless people tear you down. The only thing that keeps those forces propped up is FEAR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">FEAR keeps you from taking that bold step, from leaping off that precipice into the great beyond. FEAR is the only reason you aren't PERFECT. Thankfully, the fair and righteous RRG CORPORATION deployed the world's foremost engineers and scientists onto this issue, and they solved it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Introducing the comprehensive solution to FEAR, Amygdalum, a lifesaving breakthrough that intellectuals around the world have been raving about as the end of FEAR.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down gameplay centered around survival using your flashlight and interactive environmental tools to dispatch several unique enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable secret items hidden throughout 7 handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoverable hidden messages and multiple endings exposing the secrets of RRG</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076950?t=1773449357","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4076950?t=1773449357","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076950/c303003c1c574590fbf24f2b598aa963a7b6e508/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773449357","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076950/c303003c1c574590fbf24f2b598aa963a7b6e508/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773449357","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076950/extras/9777b435159bb6d44f348bd1a4ab20ef.avif?t=1773449357\" width=300 height=485 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The world is not fair to you. The things you need are so simple, and yet malicious forces and careless people tear you down. The only thing that keeps those forces propped up is FEAR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">FEAR keeps you from taking that bold step, from leaping off that precipice into the great beyond. FEAR is the only reason you aren't PERFECT. Thankfully, the fair and righteous RRG CORPORATION deployed the world's foremost engineers and scientists onto this issue, and they solved it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Introducing the comprehensive solution to FEAR, Amygdalum, a lifesaving breakthrough that intellectuals around the world have been raving about as the end of FEAR.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down gameplay centered around survival using your flashlight and interactive environmental tools to dispatch several unique enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collectable secret items hidden throughout 7 handcrafted levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discoverable hidden messages and multiple endings exposing the secrets of RRG</p></li></ul>","developers":["Redroot Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4076950/5b320df70a03bcb5780d0c82e6da01dd516a981b/header.jpg?t=1773449357","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4076950/352136536/3e312ec3bcc037fe357b520ac7404900b2960983/1762268619/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762714072","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4076950/352136536/3e312ec3bcc037fe357b520ac7404900b2960983/1762268619/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762714072","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4076950/352136536/3e312ec3bcc037fe357b520ac7404900b2960983/1762268619/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762714072","id":257226740,"name":"Amygdalum gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257226740/60c93ceb8a923299db2a492455569cf2c1a453ea/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762714072"}],"name":"Amygdalum","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Amygdalum - $8.00 USD","packageid":1429306,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":800}],"title":"Buy Amygdalum"}],"packages":[1429306],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6300U or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</s